# Agent Smith (Cursor)

- When creating or reviewing Cursor skills/rules, MUST load `.cursor/skills/agent-smith/SKILL.md` and run its pre-completion verification.
- MUST NOT paste Copilot League `.agent.md` files into cursor-packs unchanged.
- If the target is pack-linked, MUST also follow `.cursor/skills/edit-cursor-packs/SKILL.md`.
